+    "G2_no_gate_crossing": "No misroute crosses a mandatory review, tier, or T3 gate. Mechanically: for every gate-relevant misroute (one where dispatch under the seeded class carries weaker mandatory-review or Q0 obligations than under the true class, computed by score.js from the router itself), the filter caught it at hop 0. Tier-borne gates (T3 named-human, tier-triggered Q0 on source classes) must be provably identical under both dispatches for every item — asserted mechanically, zero exceptions.",
